(125, 1, 5, 80, '<p>The sum of the ages of Aruna and her mother is 49 years. Also 7 years ago, the mother&rsquo;s age was 4 times Aruna&rsquo;s age. Find the present age of Aruna&rsquo;s mother.</p>\r\n', '', 'No', 1, 905, 0, 0, NULL),
(126, 1, 5, 81, '<p>Mark told John &ldquo;If you give me half your money I will have Rs.75/-&rdquo;. John said,&rdquo;If you give me one third of your money, I will have Rs.75/-&rdquo;. How much money did John have?</p>\r\n', '', 'No', 1, 907, 0, 0, NULL),
